      "lineNbr": 510,
      "author": {
        "id": 11059
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-10-28T14:53:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "WDYT about moving this logic into `SkContainerAllocator` all the same, but have the method use a `template \u003ctypename T\u003e` so that the compiler can optimize away the division? \n\nThis keeps the logic centralized and reusable, but still gives us the shift or big-multiply instead of idiv.",
      "parentUuid": "468782a2_8a1dbc4a",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 506,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 510,
        "endChar": 26
      },
      "revId": "51833ff0e4d0b72c0f4c4bd2288e86b154893fd6",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
