        "filename": "include/private/SkTArray.h",
        "patchSetId": 26
      },
      "lineNbr": 510,
      "author": {
        "id": 11059
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-10-28T15:01:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "OK, I took a look--I didn\u0027t mean making the whole class templated, just one method inside the class. My thought process is that simple math like that will get inlined out entirely. (SK_ALWAYS_INLINE can really force the issue if need be)",
      "parentUuid": "52dadf4f_cc663209",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 506,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 510,
        "endChar": 26
      },
      "revId": "51833ff0e4d0b72c0f4c4bd2288e86b154893fd6",
