        "id": 5210
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-10-28T15:29:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "But since this class only has one function and all instances of that function will add to .text and to .hf_frame for each type used. It\u0027s the same as templating the class.\n\nI agree, this is a vexing problem. Let\u0027s get this in and just focus on that divide problem. We could probably pass a pointer to a function that does the divide, but I would like that in its own CL.",
      "parentUuid": "22346415_edd33484",
